    "lawCode": "Amd §505, Ag & Mkts L; amd §3302, Pub Health L",
    "lawSection": "Agriculture and Markets Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S8072\n\nSPONSOR: O'MARA\n \nTITLE OF BILL:  An act to amend the agriculture and markets law and\nthe public health law, in relation to the definitions of industrial\nhemp, concentrated cannabis, and marihuana\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nThe purpose of this legislation is to clarify the definitions of indus-\ntrial hemp, concentrated cannabis and marihuana.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1. Subdivision 1 of section 505 of the agriculture and markets\nlaw, as added by chapter 524 of the laws of 2014 is amended.\n\nSection 2: Paragraph (a) of subdivision 4 of section 3302 of the public\nhealth law is amended.\n\nSection 3: Subdivision 21 of section 3302 of the public health law is\namended.\n\nSection 4: Effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis legislation clarifies the definition of Industrial hemp, concen-\ntrated Cannabis and marihuana.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nThis is new legislation.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nThis legislation will have no fiscal implications for State and Local\nGovernments.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
